    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Quain are delighted to present this six-bedroom detached family home in the highly sought-after area of Coosan, Athlone. The property offers spacious living accommodation c.206sq.m and occupies a large private site c.0.4 Acres, which backs onto woodland. The property is in close proximity to Athlone town centre, Coosan Point, schools, local amenities and also has excellent access to the M6.Accommodation briefly comprises on the ground floor; Spacious Entrance Hall, Living Room, Dining Room, Kitchen, Utility, w.c and Integral Garage. On the first floor there are 6 bedrooms and a family bathroom and there is also a large attic room.This is a superb opportunity to purchase a large detached residence in a desirable residential location.This property is potentially eligible for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, offering up to 50,000 for renovations aimed at restoring derelict homes, subject to relevant approvals. Grant approval is subject to meeting eligibility criteria. For further details, visit www.gov.ie."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.64m x 2.99m\n\n\nLiving Room - 3.68m x 6.69m\n\n\nDining Room - 3.65m x 2.89m\n\n\nKitchen - 3.65m x 6.00m\n\n\nLaundry Room - 3.98m x 1.75m\n\n\nBathroom - 1.74m x 0.75m\n\n\nGarage - 5.84m x 4.89m\n\n\nHall - 8.63m x 3.46m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.67m x 3.38m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.48m x 3.28m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.47m x 2.38m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.65m x 2.37m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.96m x 2.37m\n\n\nBedroom 5 - 4.14m x 4.29m\n\n\nBalcony - \n\n\n"
      },
      {
